{"id":404903401,"chapter_id":50092,"scene_id":59218,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"事后，环研院花了整整两天时间对管理局地下区域做二次清理和结构复核。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"看着厚得能打死人的报告，夜莺看完后沉默了很久，最后只是把文件轻轻放下，转头开始安排新的维修与安保轮班。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"关于这次事件的定性，最终被写成了一串严谨并官方的结论。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"但如果让亲历者来说的话——","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"唉我跟你说啊小耗子，我们这次在管理局地下刷了个超——高难本。","voice":["vo_event_404903401_05"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"而且那个地方邪门得不行！又是史莱姆又是存钱罐的……更离谱的是那还有个代表厄运的狂厄造物，全程压着我们打——还好我……我们临场发挥够强，不然哪还有机会站着出来！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"海拉","content":"唉，杂鱼就是杂鱼。被压着打还吹上了。","voice":["vo_event_404903401_07"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"对了，忘了告诉你了，局长也在。","voice":["vo_event_404903401_08"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"海拉","content":"什么——！那个笨比有这么好玩的事居然不叫我！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_09"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"因为当时我们出外勤了。","voice":["vo_event_404903401_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啊——不听不听！再说了，就不能用终端通知我一下吗，明明我知道就能直接赶回来的！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"听夜莺副官说是通讯系统被狂厄场阻断的缘故。","voice":["vo_event_404903401_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哼，下次我一定要赶上这种好事！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"嗯，下次一定。","voice":["vo_event_404903401_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":2608,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":2591,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"环研院后续复盘认为，墨菲的【厄运】并没有被消灭，而是被重新纳入了一个更稳定的状态。","style":3,"background":2591,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"尽管是由厄运卷入了事件，遭遇了狂厄。但也是在与狂厄进行中和之后，她终于不再只剩下厄运。","style":3,"background":2591,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"当然，将实验材料当做礼物送出的环研院导师也遭到停职处理，接下来的日子里他将成为MBCC施工队的一员，对受损的管理局进行检修。","style":3,"background":2591,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"于是——","style":3,"background":2591,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"<i><color=#e88490>很久很久以后……</i></color>","voice":["vo_event_404903401_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":3,"background":1016,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"content":"<i><color=#e88490>哎呀，好像……也没有很久。</i></color>","voice":["vo_event_404903401_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":3,"background":1016,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"<i><color=#e88490>对狄斯城来说，能安安稳稳过完一周，都已经算是值得写进年鉴的大事了。</i></color>","voice":["vo_event_404903401_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":3,"background":1016,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"content":"<i><color=#e88490>总之，在某个看似平平无奇、实际上也没那么平平无奇的工作日里——</i></color>","voice":["vo_event_404903401_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":3,"background":1016,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"管理局工作人员","content":"侦测到禁闭者墨菲的狂厄反应，准备进行收容！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"管理局工作人员","content":"各单位注意，禁闭者墨菲依然持有厄运相关能力！请保持警惕！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"管理局工作人员","content":"什么？！收容网在发射前一秒发生了短路，现在困住了三名己方队员？","voice":["vo_event_404903401_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"管理局工作人员","content":"一队撤离！二队强行接入！快！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"speaker":"管理局工作人员","content":"二队？二队请报告情况！……什么叫所有催泪瓦斯都被引爆了，你们看不清现场状况？！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"管理局工作人员","content":"——唉……报告，禁闭者墨菲当前定位不明。请求MBCC局长协助。","voice":["vo_event_404903401_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"问讯处还是老样子，自琪琪的伤好以后，她的生活便不曾发生过变化。但也不是完全的一成不变——","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"content":"她最近喜欢上了种四叶草，因为她得到了一位曾经的朋友托人送给她的种子，还说这是异世界的种子，会给人带来好运。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"voice":["vo_event_404903401_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"夜莺终于看完了报告，又抬头看了看坐在办公桌后、肩膀上还缠着厚厚绷带的${PlayerName}，沉默了很久。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"content":"最后，她只是把文件轻轻放下，无奈地叹了口气。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"维修和安保的轮班我已经重新安排好了。另外，您的外勤申请在伤完全好之前，我都会无限期驳回。","voice":["vo_event_404903401_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"content":"<i><color=#e88490>至于那个消失在报告里的红发身影——</i></color>","voice":["vo_event_404903401_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":3,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"content":"<i><color=#e88490>谁知道呢。</i></color>","voice":["vo_event_404903401_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":3,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"content":"<i><color=#e88490>说不定这一次，命运真的愿意大发慈悲，让她在某个没人看见的转角，捡到一点不那么倒霉的好运。</i></color>","voice":["vo_event_404903401_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":3,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"等下——！这刹车怎么又坏了啊——！！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"局长——！救命啊！","voice":["vo_event_404903401_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49034","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1}]}